    {
      "title": "ETF adoption and equity market macroefficiency",
      "source": "City St George's, University of London working paper / open access record",
      "year": 2025,
      "takeaway": "ETF introduction can improve how equity markets incorporate macro information; the result is strongest in developed markets with larger ETF growth.",
